cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MTLA, please cite the paper."
title: "MTLA: Multi-Token Localized Attention for VLM Grounding Verification"
abstract: >-
  A training-free, post-hoc confidence score that detects hallucinated grounding
  predictions from multimodal LLMs by measuring how strongly a prediction's output
  tokens attend to evidence inside its own proposal region.
